@startuml environment_manager
package environment {
  class EnvironmentManager {
    - gameWindow: window.GameWindow
    - lighting: Lighting
    + EnvironmentManager(gameWindow: window.GameWindow)
    + setUp(): void
    + draw(g2: java.awt.Graphics2D): void
  }

  class Lighting {
    - gameWindow: window.GameWindow
    - darknessFilter: java.awt.image.BufferedImage
    + Lighting(gameWindow: window.GameWindow, circleSize: int)
    + draw(g2: java.awt.Graphics2D): void
  }
}

package window {
  class GameWindow {
    + getPlayer(): Player
    + otherWindowMethods(): void
  }

  class Player {
    + getScreenX(): int
    + getScreenY(): int
    + otherPlayerMethods(): void
  }
}

EnvironmentManager "1" *-- "0..1" Lighting : manages
EnvironmentManager ..> GameWindow : uses
Lighting ..> GameWindow : reads player position
GameWindow "1" o-- "0..1" Player : has

note right of EnvironmentManager
**Notes**
- setUp() で Lighting を初期化する。
- draw() は Lighting.draw を呼び出してオーバーレイを描画する。

- setUp() initializes the Lighting instance.
- draw() delegates to Lighting.draw to render the overlay.
end note

note right of Lighting
**Notes**
- 暗闇フィルタ（BufferedImage）を保持し、プレイヤー中心を円形に明るくする。
- フィルタは画面サイズやプレイヤー移動時に再生成する設計が望ましい。

- Holds a darkness filter (BufferedImage) and makes the area around the player circularly bright.
- The filter should be regenerated when the screen size or player position changes.
end note

@enduml